        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>了解自己 - 男士身型穿搭指南</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #e9e9e6;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #eceae5;\n    border-left: 6px solid #16305c;\n    border-right: 6px solid #16305c;\n    padding: 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* ---- Header ---- */\n  .header {\n    padding: 20px 18px 6px 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .title-tag {\n    background: #16305c;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border: 2px solid #16305c;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #eceae5 inset;\n  }\n  .brand {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #bfc9d6;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .brand .man {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .brand .sub {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  /* ---- Category labels ---- */\n  .labels {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 6px 16px 4px 16px;\n  }\n  .labels span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 90px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #16305c;\n    background: #cfd3de;\n    padding: 3px 0;\n  }\n  /* ---- Figures row ---- */\n  .figures {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n    height: 250px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #dfe0dc;\n    border: 1px dashed #16305c;\n    color: #16305c;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .fig {\n    width: 96px;\n    height: 245px;\n  }\n  /* ---- Description blocks ---- */\n  .descs {\n    padding: 16px 14px 22px 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    background: #e2f2fb;\n    border-left: 4px solid #7fc8e8;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #16305c;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"title-tag\">了解自己</div>\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"man\">M A N</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">小管穿搭日记</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"labels\">\n    <span>长条形</span>\n    <span>三角形</span>\n    <span>倒三角</span>\n    <span>长方形</span>\n    <span>椭圆形</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"figures\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder fig\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: male silhouette, 长条形 body type, with rectangular outline over legs]</figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder fig\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: male silhouette, 三角形 body type, with triangle outline over torso]</figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder fig\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: male silhouette, 倒三角 body type, with inverted triangle outline over torso]</figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder fig\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: male silhouette, 长方形 body type, with rectangle outline over torso]</figure>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder fig\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: male silhouette, 椭圆形 body type, with oval outline over torso]</figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"descs\">\n    <div class=\"desc\">\n      特征为竹竿，四肢细小，建议选择有口袋的工装风，机能风能增加视觉的厚度。学会叠穿，穿出层次感，也能弱化瘦小的视觉效果避免紧身裤，太紧身无疑是暴露竹竿型的视觉。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">\n      特征为肩膀窄，腹部有赘肉，选择挺阔面料的衣服，也能增加肩膀轮廓感<br>\n      通过上半身的配饰点缀：如项链 帽子 叠穿等，打造V领视觉\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">\n      特征为上半身显壮，肩部较宽，腿部发达，上半身可以选择胸围较宽的宽松版型衣服，下半身可以选择直筒版型平衡视觉\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">\n      特征为腰部肩部和臀部基本同宽，常见于不健身或者宅男人群，上半身可以选择落肩版型直挺材质衣服，同时缩小腰部视觉，下半身可以选择直筒型的裤子\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">\n      特征为圆润饱满，体型偏胖。上半身可以选择宽松直挺型的上衣，下半身选择宽松直筒型的裤子，修饰腿型，不宜太宽松。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
